WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:17.990 --> 00:01:23.960
Mai vs Marik
Shadow Duel

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:30.970
We will select the duelists for the third match in 15 minutes.

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:33.470
How is he?

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.210
His brain waves and body are normal.

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:43.180
I don't know why he's unconscious, but it's likely due to extreme mental shock.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:45.290
Mental shock...

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:48.090
Bakura is also unconscious from his duel.

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:50.930
This tournament is hurting too many people.

00:01:51.440 --> 00:01:53.070
But it's strange.

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:59.750
The God Card damaged both of us, so why's he the only one who's unconscious?

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.150
Because you have a thick head.

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:03.040
Be quiet!

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:06.840
Since he's asleep, we can't uncover his true identity.

00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:10.310
Is he a Ghoul?

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:13.550
He was protecting Marik to the end.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:15.930
I won't forgive Marik!

00:02:15.930 --> 00:02:20.750
Marik made this guy pretend to be him, and then he abandoned him!

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.720
He also controlled people's minds.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:24.720
He's rotten to the core!

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:29.240
Marik betrayed and abandoned him.  He's all alone.

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:33.240
I feel sorry for him.

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.100
All alone...

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:41.640
I was able to stand up in time and win.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.240
I see!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:47.550
I know why I won and he lost.

00:02:48.830 --> 00:02:51.290
I was dreaming about you all.

00:02:51.910 --> 00:02:57.870
I have friends waiting for me, but he's all alone.

00:02:59.030 --> 00:03:00.250
Jonouchi...

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:04.150
Thanks for your support.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:06.770
Jonouchi, forget about that.

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:09.210
But pay back the lunch money I loaned you.

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.080
This isn't the time for that!

00:03:11.080 --> 00:03:12.440
Stop, brother!

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.450
Friends...

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:19.780
Aren't they announcing the next matchup soon?

00:03:19.780 --> 00:03:21.050
You're right!

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:23.230
Let's leave him to the doctor.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:23.950
Yeah.

00:03:26.090 --> 00:03:27.880
Hey, Jonouchi.

00:03:27.880 --> 00:03:29.350
Can I ask you a question?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:30.790
What is it?

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:34.290
Was I in your dream?

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:37.370
With everyone else?

00:03:41.100 --> 00:03:44.200
Well...  It's...

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.730
I don't have the strength to stand up.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:01.120
Well, uhh...

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:04.130
I dreamed that I was in class.

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:06.120
So you weren't there.

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.850
You're too old be to be in high school.

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:12.630
I know!  Next time, I'll dream that you're our teacher.

00:04:12.630 --> 00:04:15.260
You'll beat up the students with a whip!

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:17.910
See you later.

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:20.130
That idiot.

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:29.350
It's too embarrassing to say that she was in my dream.

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:30.480
Ouch!

00:04:30.480 --> 00:04:31.980
Jonouchi!

00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.050
What are you doing, Anzu?

00:04:34.050 --> 00:04:35.900
That's what I should ask you!

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:38.400
You don't understand how a girl feels?

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:40.100
You're the worst!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.150
Alone...

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.580
What's got into me?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:54.170
I've always been fighting alone until I met them.

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:57.580
Alone without anyone's help.

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:01.690
I was proud about that.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:08.770
There can be only one winner, so why are we helping each other?

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.290
I'm a duelist!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:17.050
We'll now select the competitors for the third match.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.240
What's going on?

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:23.570
Marik and the 8th duelist aren't here.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.470
Wait up!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.930
Hey Kaiba, Marik used a fake name.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.070
Isn't he disqualified?

00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:32.070
Who cares.

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:34.650
That's why you're an ordinary duelist.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:35.980
What?

00:05:36.260 --> 00:05:38.770
Your name isn't important.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:43.490
As long as you have the skills to compete in this tournament.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:49.070
If I defeat Marik, I can get his Ra card.

00:05:49.070 --> 00:05:54.130
If I have two God Cards, I can easily defeat Yugi.

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:55.170
Start!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:58.270
We'll now pick the competitors!

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:01.170
Ultimate Bingo Machine!  Go!

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:06.380
My brother will compete next!

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:09.610
My only target is Marik.

00:06:12.010 --> 00:06:16.330
This lottery will also determine the competitors for the fourth duel.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:28.470
The first competitor in the third match is #4!  Mai Kujaku!

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.680
Good luck, Mai!

00:06:31.600 --> 00:06:34.370
Let's select her opponent!

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:36.300
Bingo Machine!  Go!

00:06:39.330 --> 00:06:42.700
Mai!  They haven't picked your opponent yet.

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:46.500
I'm going to win, no matter who I face.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:50.590
Yugi and Jonouchi, I'll see you in the semifinals!

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:51.880
Mai...

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:53.320
We'll come to cheer you on-

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:54.570
Don't!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:56.710
Mai...

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:58.390
I will fight alone!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.230
How are you cheers going to help me?

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:06.770
I don't recall joining your chummy group.

00:07:07.350 --> 00:07:08.350
Mai...

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.250
Jonouchi!

00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:16.290
I'm not a spoiled duelist like you who can't duel unless people cheer for you!

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:18.330
How dare you!

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:19.550
Say that again!

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.750
Brother...

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:26.190
Suit yourself.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:33.070
Give me your key.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:50.050
I'll sacrifice everyone to the darkness one by one.

00:07:50.430 --> 00:07:58.060
Rishido, the tattoo you carved into your own face sealed away my hatred.

00:07:58.530 --> 00:08:02.430
As long as you exist, I'll be imprisoned in the shadows.

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:06.240
But I'll send you back to the shadows first, Rishido.

00:08:06.240 --> 00:08:09.610
Have a nice reunion with my father in the afterlife.

00:08:09.610 --> 00:08:12.840
Mai Kujaku's opponent in the third match is...

00:08:13.230 --> 00:08:14.570
Marik Ishtar!

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:18.100
Competitors, report to the Duel Ring.

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.580
You're in luck.

00:08:21.550 --> 00:08:24.130
I'll let you live longer.

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:45.890
Marik...

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.360
He has the Ra card.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.450
The shadows are hungry.

00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.700
I will challenge a God using my own deck.

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:03.450
I'll defeat him and acquire Ra!

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:07.190
I will sacrifice you to the shadows, woman.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:16.430
I'll see how powerful a Ra deck is.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:19.790
Mai Kujaku vs Marik Ishtar!

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:21.410
Begin the third match!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:28.980
Here I go!

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.060
Duel!

00:09:34.280 --> 00:09:36.290
I'll go first!

00:09:36.730 --> 00:09:37.960
I draw a card!

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:39.760
My turn!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.330
I summon Dunames Dark Witch in attack position!

00:09:46.010 --> 00:09:47.270
I end my turn.

00:09:48.430 --> 00:09:51.000
That's a nice rare card.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.580
Time to warm up.

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:56.240
My turn.

00:09:58.010 --> 00:10:02.100
I play Revival Jam in defense position.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:08.280
And the spell card Jam Breeding Machine.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:18.000
This card creates a Slime Token every turn.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:23.920
If you don't attack soon, my field will be full of monsters.

00:10:23.920 --> 00:10:26.590
He's not revealing his strategies yet.

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.070
It's started already?

00:10:28.070 --> 00:10:29.010
Mai!

00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:30.870
Everyone...

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:34.530
Mai, do your best!

00:10:34.530 --> 00:10:35.610
Defeat Marik!

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.970
Why did you come here?

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:41.650
I said that I only believe in my strength!

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:43.330
I know that!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.440
You're free to think whatever you want!

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:50.040
So we're also free to think of you as a friend and cheer you on!

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:51.760
Do what you like!

00:10:51.760 --> 00:10:54.130
Yugi, look at the Duel Ring!

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:55.370
That's...

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.590
Revival Jam and Jam Breeding Machine!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.150
My turn!

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:10.070
Mai!  Be careful!

00:11:10.070 --> 00:11:11.150
That monster is-

00:11:11.550 --> 00:11:14.150
Yugi!  Have you lost your mind?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:15.150
Say what?

00:11:15.410 --> 00:11:20.660
No matter what he tries, it's against the rules to give me advice!

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:23.930
Mai...

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:27.070
I don't mind, woman.

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:31.040
I think you should listen to their advice.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.500
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.810
I don't need anyone's help!

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:38.480
I've come this far on my own!

00:11:38.930 --> 00:11:39.980
Mai...

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.130
Dunames Dark Witch!

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:04.900
Attack Revival Jam!

00:12:06.710 --> 00:12:08.180
Angel Dust!

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.070
Revival Jam is destroyed!

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.280
What?

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:22.780
Don't panic.

00:12:22.780 --> 00:12:26.430
Revival Jam's regeneration effect activated.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.030
Regeneration effect?

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:32.480
Let's enjoy this show.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.530
My turn.

00:12:33.790 --> 00:12:36.430
The spell card Pot of Greed.

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:47.010
Pot of Greed lets me draw two cards.

00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:51.510
And Jam Breeding Machine Special Summons a Slime Token.

00:12:57.680 --> 00:13:01.320
I set one card.

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.630
Big brother, that card is...

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:11.730
It's probably Jam Defender - a trap card that focuses attacks on Revival Jam.

00:13:11.970 --> 00:13:16.680
I see.  While Revival Jam keeps regenerating...

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:20.980
He'll gather three monsters to tribute in order to summon Ra.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:24.770
I won't let you do that!

00:13:24.770 --> 00:13:26.190
My turn!

00:13:26.190 --> 00:13:29.130
The spell card Harpie's Feather Duster!

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:40.330
Continuous Traps and Spells won't work against me!

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:41.660
Nice!

00:13:41.930 --> 00:13:43.330
Impressive, Mai.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:47.190
His strategy gave me a lot of trouble, but you broke it easily.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:51.580
Dunames Dark Witch, destroy that lame monster!

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:00.980
Yeah!  Mai has the advantage!

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:08.760
Rejoice and grab the light of hope.

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:13.500
Because the shock when you fall into despair will be multiplied.

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:16.760
I set one card!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.500
I end my turn.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:19.850
My turn.

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:24.530
I summon Melchid the Four-Face Beast.

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:29.110
I tribute Revival Jam and Melchid the Four-Face Beast.

00:14:30.630 --> 00:14:34.150
I Special Summon Masked Beast Des Gardius.

00:14:34.460 --> 00:14:35.380
That's...

00:14:35.700 --> 00:14:37.890
He's now using Masks to duel.

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:40.220
Go, Des Gardius!

00:14:40.220 --> 00:14:42.490
Attack Dunames Dark Witch!

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:45.130
I won't let you!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:48.060
I activate the trap card Mirror Wall!

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:56.320
Your monster's attack points are halved!

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.980
Dunames, strike back!

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:00.950
Angel Dust!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:06.270
All right!  Just as Mai planned!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:06.850
No...

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.730
Dunames!

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:18.390
When Des Gardius is destroyed, it activates The Mask of Remnants.

00:15:18.390 --> 00:15:21.000
I reshuffle my deck.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:24.720
And I gain control of Dunames Dark Witch.

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:28.170
I'll get rid of that annoying trap.

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:30.900
The spell card Remove Trap.

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:38.270
Damn!  He doesn't run out of monsters!

00:15:38.270 --> 00:15:42.020
Even if Mai keeps attacking, she can't deal lethal damage!

00:15:42.390 --> 00:15:44.190
No, she'll be fine.

00:15:44.190 --> 00:15:48.020
Mai can win this duel if she keeps pushing.

00:15:48.020 --> 00:15:49.690
That's right.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:53.450
If he summons Ra, it'll be hard for me to win.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:55.530
I have to win before he summons it.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.630
Here I go!

00:15:58.630 --> 00:16:01.840
I'll show you what my Amazoness Deck can do!

00:16:01.840 --> 00:16:04.510
Ooh.  I'm looking forward to it.

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:09.350
Why's he laughing like that?  Creepy.

00:16:09.350 --> 00:16:10.850
Mai, be careful!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:13.180
Be quiet!  I can't concentrate!

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.920
What's wrong with her?

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:20.500
So you're her friends.

00:16:20.500 --> 00:16:22.930
Then you'll help me...

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:26.860
...massacre her.

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:30.750
Playtime is over, woman.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:34.610
I'll sacrifice you.  I've warmed up enough.

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:35.770
Warmed up?

00:16:35.770 --> 00:16:36.770
You don't mean...

00:16:37.070 --> 00:16:39.770
I'll start the Shadow Game!

00:16:49.100 --> 00:16:50.450
What's going on?

00:16:50.700 --> 00:16:54.120
A murky fog surrounds us!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:17:00.630
You're about to experience the world's most terrifying game.

00:17:00.830 --> 00:17:04.640
It's not the altitude that's making it hard to breathe.

00:17:04.990 --> 00:17:07.140
This black fog is...

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:11.040
This also happened when Pegasus dueled Yugi.

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:12.610
A Shadow Game.

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:14.280
That's right, Yugi.

00:17:14.280 --> 00:17:20.020
You know that hatred can make the night even darker.

00:17:20.370 --> 00:17:22.150
Marik!  Stop!

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:26.260
My grudge is the source of this darkness.

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:32.160
Yugi, your death is the only thing that can clear this darkness.

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:34.100
The shadows are hungry.

00:17:34.100 --> 00:17:36.760
This woman will be sacrificed to the shadows.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:38.060
Mai!

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.610
This duel is dangerous!

00:17:39.610 --> 00:17:41.300
You'll die if you lose!

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:43.500
Stop dueling!

00:17:43.740 --> 00:17:46.510
Are you mocking me, Yugi?

00:17:46.510 --> 00:17:51.830
A duelist's heart dies when she turns her back to her opponent!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:54.520
I thought you knew that best!

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:55.630
Mai!

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:57.860
Yugi, Jonouchi!

00:17:57.860 --> 00:18:01.020
I'll win this duel, no matter what!

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:03.860
So that I can duel you next!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:09.870
Good.  Embrace life and raise your voice, woman!

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:14.810
Season it with the spice of pride to create the finest dinner!

00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:17.210
Yugi, it's no use.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:19.080
Let her do what she wants.

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:22.500
Once she makes up her mind, she never backs down.

00:18:22.860 --> 00:18:23.540
Mai...

00:18:23.880 --> 00:18:26.550
Don't you dare lose, Mai!

00:18:26.780 --> 00:18:27.910
Here I go, Marik!

00:18:29.090 --> 00:18:31.290
Let's start the Shadow Game!

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:33.490
Mai, be careful.

00:18:33.490 --> 00:18:37.290
Since you're dueling, only you can know what his Shadow Game is like.

00:18:38.660 --> 00:18:40.160
My turn!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:42.970
I set one card.  Then...

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:46.700
I summon The Unfriendly Amazon!

00:18:48.380 --> 00:18:49.960
What's this light?

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:58.010
Since you're participating in this Shadow Game, you should be able to see your monster's light.

00:18:58.940 --> 00:19:02.220
That light sustains your existence.

00:19:02.570 --> 00:19:05.020
Sustain my existence?

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:09.170
Instead of explaining with words, you'll understand easier if you experience it.

00:19:09.170 --> 00:19:11.530
This is a game of fear and pain.

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:16.440
You'll experience it greater than any duel before!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:20.860
There's madness in his eyes.

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.200
I won't be intimidated!

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:27.090
The Unfriendly Amazon attacks Dunames Dark Witch!

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.150
Well done.

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:39.790
I lost a few life points, but Dunames Dark Witch originally belonged to you.

00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:43.460
So the shadow effect activates against you.

00:19:43.680 --> 00:19:45.130
Shadow effect?

00:19:45.130 --> 00:19:46.460
That's right.

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:53.580
All monsters on the field contain the souls of people that exist in our memories.

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:59.210
When the monster is destroyed, that person also vanishes from our memories.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:00.880
Impossible!

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:03.880
Yugi, what's Marik talking about?

00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:08.120
Marik is already using his dark powers on Mai.

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:12.880
I wonder who's going to be erased from your memories?

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:14.060
Anzu!

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:17.630
She'll vanish from your memories.

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:19.500
Anzu...

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.130
I'll lose my memories of Anzu?

00:20:24.060 --> 00:20:30.910
Mai Kujaku, I know your emotional weaknesses.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:35.050
My eyes can see the truth in people.

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:41.200
I can see what will give you the most pain, the best way for you to die.

00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.520
I can see you all alone.

00:20:47.520 --> 00:20:51.450
You're lonely, crying like a baby.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:57.400
Mai Kujaku, what you fear the most is being alone as your friends vanish.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:00.020
That's not true!

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:04.450
Then try to remember that girl's face.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.040
I can't remember!

00:21:08.260 --> 00:21:12.780
You're one step closer to true loneliness.

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.520
Mai!  What's wrong?

00:21:19.740 --> 00:21:20.690
Mai!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:32.750
Mai Kujaku, you have the pleasure of dying in loneliness and despair.

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:36.500
That's why this is a Shadow Game.

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:50.150
Marik's dark side created a Shadow Game that erased Mai's memories about me!

00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:53.210
He's also erasing Jonouchi from her memories!

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:54.840
Don't lose, Mai!

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:58.070
If you defeat Marik, your memories will return!

00:21:58.840 --> 00:22:02.400
Mai's monster stole Marik's card?

00:22:02.400 --> 00:22:04.700
Can that card be...

00:22:04.700 --> 00:22:07.440
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Steal the God Card

00:22:07.440 --> 00:22:09.300
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:21.600
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.600 --> 00:22:30.540
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:35.510
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.510 --> 00:22:39.480
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.910 --> 00:22:47.450
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:51.020
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.020 --> 00:22:55.790
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.790 --> 00:23:05.900
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:13.510
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:22.480
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:30.460
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:40.300
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
